{"3091260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Darkbound", "steam_appid": 3091260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/08e4285552135c0b856f2c7dc053ad42.avif?t=1782902773\" width=614 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in your hospital room in the middle of the night and you don't know how much time has passed. Find a way out of this nightmare before it’s too late. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/0b5d3748fa032e9c6676cf994730a987.avif?t=1782902773\" width=614 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something must be wrong, <strong>being in the dark hurts</strong>. You have to get out before that thing finds you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/db02337390ff8b5bc17717643d9ba220.poster.avif?t=1782902773\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/db02337390ff8b5bc17717643d9ba220.webm?t=1782902773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/db02337390ff8b5bc17717643d9ba220.mp4?t=1782902773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/5fd5c64bb049938fae5ed9d6f75f4a30.avif?t=1782902773\" width=614 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather tools and information to help you s